<template><div><h1 id="datatable-extra-buttons" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#datatable-extra-buttons"><span>DataTable Extra Buttons</span></a></h1>
<p>A comprehensive set of button components for enhancing data tables with import, export, and bulk operations functionality.</p>
<h2 id="overview" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#overview"><span>Overview</span></a></h2>
<p>The DataTable Extra Buttons suite provides:</p>
<ul>
<li>📤 <strong>Export</strong>: Export all data or selected rows</li>
<li>📥 <strong>Import</strong>: Import data from JSON, CSV, and Excel files</li>
<li>🗑️ <strong>Bulk Delete</strong>: Delete multiple selected rows</li>
<li>🔐 <strong>Permission-aware</strong>: Integrated with permission system</li>
<li>🎨 <strong>Dark mode</strong>: Full dark mode support</li>
<li>✨ <strong>Drag &amp; Drop</strong>: File upload with drag and drop</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="components" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#components"><span>Components</span></a></h2>
<h3 id="datatableextrabuttons" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#datatableextrabuttons"><span>DataTableExtraButtons</span></a></h3>
<p>Main wrapper component that renders configured buttons.</p>
